<title>GERMANY: Suedzucker 1996/97 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Suedzucker 1996/97 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 28:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   286     vs 223</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    482     vs 459</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (DVFA/SG)   47.70   vs 41.50 marks</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    855     vs 802</p>
<p>    Return on equity			   15.5    vs 13.1 pct</p>
<p>Dividend:</p>
<p>     Ordinary stock			    17.00   vs 15.50 marks</p>
<p>     Preferred stock			   19.00   vs 17.50 marks</p>
<p>    Workforce (average)			19,239  vs 19,539</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Suedzucker AG.</p>
</text>
